{#
  Renders a guidance page's Sources table from its `sources` frontmatter.

  The frontmatter is the single declaration: `verify:guidance` gates it, and this partial publishes
  it, so the table a reader sees and the record a refresh sweep reads cannot drift apart. Pages that
  restate nothing declare `sources: original` and render no table.

  See docs/guides/developer/guidance-provenance.md.
#}
{% if sources and sources != 'original' %}
## Sources

| Source | Governs | Last reviewed |
| --- | --- | --- |
{% for source in sources -%}
{% if source.url -%}
| [{{ source.title or source.url }}]({{ source.url }}) | {{ source.governs }} | {{ source.reviewed }} |
{% else -%}
| [{{ source.title or (source.repository + "/" + source.path) }}](https://github.com/{{ source.repository }}/blob/{{ source.ref }}/{{ source.path }}) at `{{ source.ref }}` | {{ source.governs }} | {{ source.reviewed }} |
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
